    "digdeeper": {
      "type": "zeta-accordion",
      "blocks": {
        "a1": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "label": "Description",
            "content": "<h3>The daily <em>foundation</em>.</h3><p>ZETA MULTI features a premium multivitamin/mineral blend of high-quality vitamin and mineral forms selected for optimum utilization. Comprehensive nutrient profile, delivered in a vegetarian capsule, that supports foundational wellness — including antioxidant activity with vitamins C and E, selenium, and beta-carotene — plus support for daily detoxification.</p><h4>Clinical Applications</h4><ul>\n<li>Supports foundational daily nutrition</li>\n<li>Supports energy production via methylated B-vitamins</li>\n<li>Supports antioxidant activity</li>\n<li>Supports daily detoxification pathways</li>\n<li>Supports mineral status with chelated forms</li>\n</ul><p style=\"font-size:11.5px;color:var(--zeta-mid);font-style:italic;margin-top:28px;\">*These statements have not been evaluated by the Food and Drug Administration. This product is not intended to diagnose, treat, cure, or prevent any disease.</p>",
            "open_by_default": true
          }
        },
        "a2": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "label": "Ingredients",
            "content": "<h3>What's <em>in it.</em> Every milligram.</h3><p>Every nutrient, every dose, listed.</p><h4>Per 2-capsule serving</h4><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Vitamin A</strong> — 1,750 mcg RAE · <strong>Vitamin C</strong> — 250 mg · <strong>Vitamin D3</strong> — 25 mcg / 1,000 IU · <strong>Vitamin E</strong> — 67 mg · <strong>Vitamin K</strong> — 80 mcg (K1 + K2 as MK-7)</li>\n</ul><h4>Methylated B-Complex</h4><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Thiamin B1</strong> — 20 mg (benfotiamine) · <strong>Riboflavin B2</strong> — 6.8 mg (R-5-P) · <strong>Niacin B3</strong> — 50 mg NE · <strong>B6</strong> — 8.5 mg (P-5-P) · <strong>Folate</strong> — 680 mcg DFE (Quatrefolic® 5-MTHF) · <strong>B12</strong> — 500 mcg (methylcobalamin) · <strong>Biotin</strong> — 400 mcg · <strong>B5</strong> — 50 mg · <strong>Choline</strong> — 50 mg</li>\n</ul><h4>Albion® Chelated Minerals + Trace</h4><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Calcium</strong> 100 mg · <strong>Magnesium</strong> 100 mg · <strong>Zinc</strong> 15 mg · <strong>Copper</strong> 1 mg · <strong>Manganese</strong> 1 mg · <strong>Iodine</strong> 100 mcg · <strong>Selenium</strong> 100 mcg · <strong>Chromium</strong> 200 mcg · <strong>Molybdenum</strong> 75 mcg · <strong>Boron</strong> 2 mg · <strong>Vanadium</strong> 25 mcg</li>\n</ul><h4>Why these forms matter</h4><p><strong>Methylated B-vitamins</strong> skip the conversion step — people with the MTHFR variant (30–40% of the population) actually absorb them. <strong>Albion® chelated minerals</strong> are bound to amino acids — far better absorbed than cheap oxide forms. <strong>Quatrefolic® folate</strong> is already in the bioactive 5-MTHF form your body uses directly.</p>",
            "open_by_default": false
          }
        },
        "a3": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "label": "Directions & Precautions",
            "content": "<h3>How to <em>take it.</em>\n</h3><p><strong>Take 2 capsules once daily with a meal.</strong> Fat-soluble vitamins (A, D, E, K) absorb better with some dietary fat.</p><h4>Best Time</h4><p>With your largest meal of the day. Morning or midday works well — B-vitamins can be mildly energizing.</p><h4>The Foundation Stack</h4><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>ZETA D+K</strong> — extra D3 + K2 for biomarker shifts; the longevity pair</li>\n<li>\n<strong>ZETA MEGAS</strong> — omega-3s; fat-soluble, absorb well taken together</li>\n<li>\n<strong>ZETA B COMPLETE</strong> — targeted B support on top of the multi base</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Z-83</strong> — the everyday supplement for energy and clearing brain fog</li>\n</ul><h4>Precautions</h4><p>If pregnant, nursing, or under 18, consult your healthcare provider. Iron-deficient? Talk to your doctor — ZETA MULTI does not contain iron by design. Don't exceed 2 capsules per day.</p>",
            "open_by_default": false
          }
